[?2004l[?2004h> # Experiment CTR readout
[?2004l[?2004h> 
[?2004l[?2004h> Readout pipeline for experiment exports of the documented four-file layout. The agreed analysis plan is
[?2004l[?2004h> `EXPERIMENT.md`.
[?2004l[?2004h> 
[?2004l[?2004h> Run from this top-level folder:
[?2004l[?2004h> 
[?2004l[?2004h>     python -m abtest.report --data <export-folder> --out <result.json>
[?2004l[?2004h> 
[?2004l[?2004h> | Path | What it is |
[?2004l[?2004h> |---|---|
[?2004l[?2004h> | `abtest/load.py` | reads exports, parses mixed-offset timestamps as UTC instants, deduplicates exact assignment rows, and keeps pageviews at or after assignment |
[?2004l[?2004h> | `abtest/filters.py` | keeps hash-randomized users and excludes users flagged by client-based bot rules |
[?2004l[?2004h> | `abtest/report.py` | derives product-open clicks from `module_clicks`, aggregates by user, and writes the JSON readout |
[?2004l[?2004h> | `abtest/stats.py` | user-level delta-method CTR interval and the planned SRM test |
[?2004l[?2004h> | `docs/` | authoritative data-platform documentation and the launch record |
[?2004l[?2004h> | `output/result.json` | last generated readout |
[?2004l[?2004h> MD
